.TH "VINPUT\-GUI" "1" "September 2026" "fcitx5\-vinput" "fcitx5\-vinput User Manual"
.SH NAME
vinput\-gui \- Graphical configuration and resource management tool for
fcitx5\-vinput
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]vinput\-gui\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[B]vinput\-gui\f[R] is the Qt\-based desktop graphical interface for
\f[B]fcitx5\-vinput\f[R].
.PP
It provides a user\-friendly interface for:
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Audio & Control\f[R]: Selecting PipeWire microphone capture
devices, adjusting recording gain, toggling VAD (Voice Activity
Detection), and managing daemon service state.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Resource Management\f[R]: Browsing, downloading, activating, and
uninstalling offline ASR models (\f[B]sherpa\-onnx\f[R]), cloud ASR
provider scripts, and LLM adapter scripts from the online registry.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]LLM & Scenes\f[R]: Configuring OpenAI\-compatible LLM providers,
writing custom prompt templates, setting context history lines, and
managing postprocessing scenes.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Hotwords\f[R]: Managing custom vocabulary and domain\-specific
words for local recognition models.
